---
title: Model Cascade — Structure
layout: tree-down
hSpacing: 55
vSpacing: 120
---

request [class] "Request"
cheap [class] "Cheap Model" { methods: "answer()" }
gate [class] "Confidence Gate" { methods: "confident?" }
strong [class] "Strong Model" { methods: "answer()" }
answer [class] "Answer"

request -> cheap
cheap -> gate "draft"
gate -> answer "accept"
gate -> strong "escalate"
strong -> answer
